WEBVTT

00:16:25.246 --> 00:16:30.996
And I suppose the aggressive ones don't
necessarily use their brains.

00:16:30.996 --> 00:16:35.162
And maybe if you use your intelligence
to get to the top,

00:16:35.162 --> 00:16:38.121
you can use your intelligence
to stay up there.

00:16:38.662 --> 00:16:42.579
That tracks is one of the mechanisms that
I was thinking about, which is that,

00:16:42.579 --> 00:16:44.412
you know, when studying humans,

00:16:44.412 --> 00:16:48.746
I've seen pretty consistently that
the dominance path to the top,

00:16:48.746 --> 00:16:53.662
as is often the shortest, but also the
shortest lived because if that's

00:16:53.662 --> 00:16:56.412
the strategy that's that's going
to get people there,

00:16:56.662 --> 00:17:00.496
then you only last until there's another
more dominant individual who's going